# Pinned upstream revisions. realmctl and CI read this file; the Dockerfiles take
# them as build-args. Bump deliberately and rebuild the images.
MANGOS_CLASSIC_COMMIT=de8f72993b9e1faa1bf92dd5505f3daec5cea3ce
CLASSIC_DB_COMMIT=4d230bb1bd477948cac61c107d2718b3ea04a5b8
# github.com/cmangos/playerbots, dropped into src/modules/PlayerBots; moves with the core pin.
PLAYERBOTS_COMMIT=31e0f32b543fee46941db51225bb7b432eace236
WENILLA_REPO=https://github.com/Arnesen/wenilla
# A full commit hash, never a branch name — branch names are not reproducible builds.
# This one is the head of `soundscape-off-the-frame`, NOT of `main`, and it carries two things
# `main` does not.
#
# 1. The zone soundscape fix. The browser build used to fetch and decode its music and ambience
#    beds synchronously on the main thread, so every zone line and doorway froze the frame for
#    ~200 ms plus a download (measured 220 ms over loopback alone). Arnesen/wenilla#14 has the
#    diagnosis; it is closed unmerged because upstream syncing force-resets `main`.
# 2. The JavaScript bridge (Arnesen/wenilla#16) — `window.wenilla` on the play page: live game
#    state out, commands in, and the hidden-tab keepalive the desktop notifications stand on.
#
# The bridge branched off `main`, so neither branch contained the other; Arnesen/wenilla#17
# merged them into `soundscape-off-the-frame` and this pins that merge commit.
#
# ⚠ THE LINE BELOW IS OVERWRITTEN BY AUTOMATION. `bump-realm-pin.yml` in Arnesen/wenilla fires
# on every push to that repo's `main` and rewrites it to that sha — which has now happened three
# times (f41fa747 → 52b0c45 → 46a1fd9c → bf1be553), each time silently dropping the soundscape
# fix while leaving this comment in place to contradict it. Until that workflow is taught to
# refuse a pin that does not contain the current one, RE-CHECK THIS VALUE after anything lands
# on wenilla `main`. See the PR that added this note for the proposed fix (a release branch the
# workflow follows, plus an ancestry ratchet).
#
# **Do not delete `soundscape-off-the-frame`** — realm.Dockerfile reaches this commit with a
# full `git clone` plus `git checkout`, which resolves a branch commit only while some ref
# still contains it.
WENILLA_COMMIT=c055aa387cda00e211386ce6ba442a1059d2496c
